{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug Off</strong> is a relaxing bug-squashing game with minimal pressure on the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your mission is simple:</strong> squash bugs with your feet to keep the room clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Move strategically to stop bugs from escaping.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Earn points for squashing bugs and compete with other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Achievements:</strong> Your extra effort will be rewarded and remembered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Controller Support:</strong> Fully compatible with Steam Input for a smooth controller experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Steam Deck Support:</strong> Optimized UI and gameplay for a great experience on the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667660?t=1746173187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3667660?t=1746173187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667660/0386ee2086f84e20e4ed4cfb34b17608917c808d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746173187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3667660/0386ee2086f84e20e4ed4cfb34b17608917c808d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746173187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3690430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bug Off</strong>